# Optional. Copy to viewer/.env (git-ignored, never commit it) and paste a Cesium ion access token to enable
# Cesium World Terrain, Bing/Cesium imagery and Cesium OSM Buildings. Without it the viewer uses OpenStreetMap
# tiles (online) or Natural Earth (offline) on a plain ellipsoid, plus the simulation scene's own buildings.
# Create a token at https://ion.cesium.com/tokens (free account).
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
